    "text": "SANA-Video 2.0 uses Hybrid Linear-Softmax Attention, combining gated linear attention with periodic gated-softmax anchors at a 3:1 ratio to maintain full-rank token interactions while avoiding quadratic attention.",
    "topic": "attention mechanism"
  },
  {
    "text": "Block Attention Residuals (AttnRes) in SANA-Video 2.0 route completed block summaries into later linear layers, increasing the effective rank of deep layers by approximately 12%.",
    "topic": "attention residuals"
  },
  {
    "text": "SANA-Video 2.0 is designed to generate high-quality video up to 720p resolution on a single GPU, matching the quality of full-softmax video diffusion transformers while retaining efficient long-sequence scaling.",
    "topic": "video generation"
  },
  {
    "text": "From-scratch training of SANA-Video 2.0 allows it to learn the complete hybrid attention mechanism directly, without linearizing pretrained models.",
    "topic": "training approach"
  },
  {
    "text": "Reduced-resolution proxy studies for SANA-Video 2.0 indicate that a 25% softmax ratio provides the optimal trade-off between quality and efficiency.",
    "topic": "optimization"
  }
